# ME8 — UI copy judgment (whole product)

**Disc:** `docs/MOB-DISC-UI-COPY-TEACH-STRIP-JUDGMENT-CONCEPT-20260810.md`

## Concept

Not “delete all hints.” Not “teach on every page.”

| Bucket | Do |
|--------|-----|
| **A** Title already clear / coach talk | **REMOVE** (`hidden` + clear) |
| **B** Misconfig / IT risk | **One** short professional line |
| **C** Empty, error, confirm, modal gate, once-wizard | **KEEP** |

Agent decides buckets. Operator PASS/FAIL after hard refresh. Do not dump 70-key homework on the operator.

Manuals teach fully. Words/visibility only. Ask before whole-UI Grep. Exact **`MOB-APPLY`** for edits.

**Judgment APPLY:** `UI-COPY-PANEL-INTRO-JUDGMENT-V1`
